Source: pg-schedoc
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/ZeroGachis/pg_schedoc

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-schedoc
Architecture: all
Provides: postgresql-pg-schedoc
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, postgresql-PGVERSION-ddl-historization (>= 0.0.8)
Description: Cross documentation between Django and DBT projects
 schedoc generates automatic schema documentation from COMMENT metadata on
 PostgreSQL objects. It requires ddl_historization in the same schema. Column
 comments use a JSON format with predefined values such as status.
